{"translation":{"id":"lif_wbt","name":"ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢ ᤐᤠ᤺ᤴᤈᤠᤰ ᤁᤢᤛᤱ ᤔᤠᤱᤜᤢᤵ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=lifNT","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=lifNT","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"WBT","englishName":"Limbu NT (Limbu Script)","language":"lif","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"6116919e88a76086a83bb2f30e555928fb0b93d877561f10c5d7384878062fd6","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":27,"totalNumberOfChapters":260,"totalNumberOfVerses":7875,"languageName":"Limbu","languageEnglishName":"Limbu"},"book":{"id":"GAL","translationId":"lif_wbt","name":"ᤃᤗᤠᤋᤡ","commonName":"ᤃᤗᤠᤋᤡ","title":"ᤐᤠᤘᤗᤖᤧ ᤃᤗᤠᤋᤡᤜᤠ᤹ ᤜᤠᤰᤋᤢᤛᤡᤒᤠ ᤛᤰᤀᤡᤱᤄᤱ","order":48,"numberOfChapters":6,"sha256":"1c41c572af76064bf6c45947936d411065e9469d63bd3f054da5f0e408432986","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/GAL/1.json","lastChapterNumber":6,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/GAL/6.json","totalNumberOfVerses":148},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ᤐᤠᤘᤗ ᤏᤢ ᤘᤣ᤹ ᤛᤣ᤺ᤰᤕᤢᤰᤔᤡᤒᤠᤜᤠ᤹"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["ᤋᤱᤒᤣ ᤌᤡᤰ-ᤗᤡ (᥇᥊) ᤀᤣᤃᤠᤱ ᤀᤡᤱᤃᤠ᤹ ᤒᤖᤏᤠᤒᤠᤛᤧᤴᤏᤢ ᤕᤠᤶᤔᤥ ᤕᤖᤢᤛᤗᤧᤔ ᤌᤥ ᤐᤣᤃᤠᤱᤅᤡᤸᤗᤧ ᤋᤡᤋᤛᤧᤴᤏᤠᤱ ᤀᤡᤱᤃᤠ᤹ᤏᤢᤀᤣ ᤛᤥᤖᤡᤰ ᤋᤣ᤹ᤖᤢᤱᤅᤠᤱ ᤘᤕᤧ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢᤔᤠᤱᤅᤡᤸᤗᤧ ᤀᤡᤱᤃᤠ᤹ ᤂᤧᤳᤌᤥ ᤐᤣ᤺ᤰᤔᤠᤀᤣ ᤐᤥ᤺ᤱ ᤗ᤹ᤖᤡᤰ ᤀᤥ᤺ᤴᤎᤠᤰᤋᤠᤱᤅᤠᤱ ᤘᤕᤧ॥ ᤀᤡᤱᤃᤠ᤹ ᤂᤧᤵᤔᤥ ᤘᤕᤠᤱᤅᤡᤸᤗᤧ ᤂᤧᤵᤔᤥᤒᤠ ᤛᤣᤛᤣᤜᤢᤵᤗᤰᤁᤥᤒᤠ ᤗᤠᤶᤗᤥ᤺ᤒᤠᤛᤡᤖᤥ ᤑᤠ᤹ᤀᤠᤱ ᤔᤧᤀᤡ᤺ᤳᤋᤢᤛᤡᤒᤠᤜᤠ᤹ ᤛᤫᤠ᤺ᤳᤋᤠᤱ ᤋᤢᤔᤢᤱᤛᤡᤱᤅᤠᤱ ᤀᤡᤱᤃᤠ᤹ ᤌᤡᤶᤔᤧᤴᤍᤱ ᤛᤢᤘᤠᤱᤜᤠ᤹ ᤀᤡᤱᤓᤥ᤺ᤛᤢᤱᤛᤡᤱᤒᤠ ᤛᤢᤏᤠᤀᤡᤱᤅᤡᤴ ᤆᤧᤰᤋᤢᤱᤛᤡᤱᤗᤥ॥ ᤂᤧᤱᤜᤠ᤹ᤖᤧ ᤀᤠᤒᤠ᤺ᤴᤏᤡᤴ ᤔᤧᤄᤧᤵᤛᤢᤖ ᤁᤧᤗ᤹ᤒᤠ ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ ᤀᤡ᤺ᤳᤋᤢᤱᤅᤠᤱ ᤘᤕᤠᤱ. ᤔᤧ᤺ᤴᤏᤧ ᤑᤠ᤹ᤃᤪ ᤀᤡᤱᤃᤠ᤹ ᤆᤥᤃᤢᤱᤒᤠ ᤔᤠᤱᤛᤣᤘᤠ᤺ᤴ ᤜᤏᤧ ᤁᤧᤒᤥ᤺ᤱᤒᤠ ᤘᤕᤧᤖᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["ᤁᤖ ᤀᤠᤴᤍᤣ᤺ᤱᤒᤠ ᤋᤡᤋᤛᤧᤴ ᤌᤡᤶᤔᤧᤴᤍᤱ ᤛᤢᤘᤠᤱ ᤘᤕᤧᤛᤠᤱ ᤂᤧᤸᤗᤧ ᤜᤷᤍᤥ ᤜᤧᤰᤔᤠ ᤐᤥ᤺ᤱ ᤑᤠ᤹ᤀᤠᤱ ᤔᤧᤶᤒᤠ᤺ᤳᤋᤢᤴᤗᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["ᤁᤖ ᤁᤢᤓᤠ ᤀᤡᤱᤗᤧᤰᤁᤣ ᤑᤢ᤹ᤏᤢᤛᤠ᤹ᤜᤠ᤹ ᤂᤪᤡᤛ᤻ᤋ ᤕᤧᤛᤢᤗᤠᤶ ᤂᤥ᤺ᤛᤢᤶᤒᤧᤒᤠ ᤆᤥ᤺ᤰᤕᤢᤶᤓᤥ᤺ᤴ ᤌᤥ᤺ᤶᤛᤧ ᤀᤠᤏᤡᤃᤧᤏᤢ ᤔᤧᤓᤢᤳᤇᤡᤱᤅᤠᤱ ᤀᤠᤏᤡᤃᤧ ᤕᤥ᤺ᤰᤐᤠ ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤣ ᤆᤥ᤺ᤰᤛᤧ ᤂᤢᤏᤡ᤹ ᤕᤜᤢᤍᤡ ᤛᤠᤶᤕᤥᤌᤡᤶᤜᤠ᤹ ᤀᤡ᤺ᤵᤔᤠ ᤏᤠ᤺ᤵᤔᤠ ᤐᤥ᤺ᤱ ᤗ᤹ᤖᤡᤰ ᤔᤧᤔᤧᤳᤋᤡᤃᤧᤒᤠᤸᤗᤧ ᤆᤥᤃᤢᤸᤗᤧ ᤁᤴ ᤁᤠ